### Use VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP client. Run Create, then copy its id below.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@requestKey = REPLACE_WITH_FUNCTION_KEY_FOR_AZURE
@runId = REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_ID

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Create a fresh set (Azure requires a function key; local Core Tools disables auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/runs
x-functions-key: {{requestKey}}

### Progress (public; expected=50 images, uniqueStations=39 and repeatedImages=11 for the current feed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{runId}}

### Results (50 separate imageId/photoId values; stationId repeats for reused stations; SAS valid for one hour)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/images

### Invalid ID -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/invalid

### Unknown ID -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/runs/00000000000000000000000000000000

### Missing authentication -> 401 on Azure
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/runs
